    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Ntisubiza</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">Yerekana inyinjiriro za TV na porogaramu zayo zose, ihindura inyinjiriro kuri TV zititaye ku tubuto twa HDMI, kandi kuri zimwe igena urumuri. Ikoresha uburyo bwa debugging bwa TV (ADB). Utubuto no kwandika bikora kimwe na nta bwo.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Huza</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV yanze guhuza. Reba niba USB debugging ifunguye. Kuva kuri Android TV 14, TV zimwe zemera Wireless debugging gusa, TennaRC itarabasha gukoresha.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging irafunze kuri TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">TV yibagiwe iyi telefoni, nk\'uko Android TV ibigenza ku gikoresho itabonye mu cyumweru. Ongera ugerageze, maze ubyemere kuri TV.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten_short">TV yibagiwe iyi telefoni</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed">Nta wabyemeye kuri TV. Ongera ugerageze, maze uhitemo OK aho.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_not_allowed_short">Ntibyemewe kuri TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_off">Bizimye. Byongeraho inyinjiriro na porogaramu zose</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Kanda Huza, hanyuma kuri TV hitamo Always allow maze ukande OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Fungura Developer options, iri iruhande rwa About, maze ufungure USB debugging. Kuri Shield ni Network debugging.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Kuri TV, fungura Settings › System › About maze uhitemo Android TV OS build inshuro zirindwi. Kuri TV za kera ni Device Preferences › About › Build.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_title">Guhuza kw\'abakora porogaramu</string>
    <string name="dev_link_turn_off">Zimya</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Wireless debugging ni yo yonyine ifunguye, kandi TennaRC ntirabasha kuyikoresha. Fungura na USB debugging, cyangwa uhuze rimwe ukoresheje mudasobwa maze ukoreshe adb tcpip 5555; bimara kugeza TV yongeye gutangira.</string>
